## Blowfish theme

`themes/blowfish/` is a copy of Blowfish v3.9.0
(<https://github.com/nunocoracao/blowfish>), vendored into this repository
instead of being declared as a submodule, because `github.com:443` is not
reachable from the build machine and `codeload.github.com` is.

The copy was **trimmed only**: `scripts/update-theme.sh` removes material that
this site does not build — `exampleSite/`, `images/`, theme documentation,
GitHub/CI metadata, and the theme's own npm tooling under
`themes/blowfish/scripts/` (Firebase seeding scripts with a separate
dependency tree; removing it also keeps dependency scanners away from a
directory Hugo never builds). No theme source file is edited by hand — site-level customisation
belongs in this repository's own `config/` (and `layouts/` or `assets/`, if
ever added). Re-running `scripts/update-theme.sh` replaces the whole directory.

